  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Investment in New Forests Tropical Asia Forest Fund 2 L.P.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The fund plans to invest primarily in high-quality forestry assets for a variety of end markets, including timber, rubber, bioenergy, and environmental products. The fund seeks to develop a portfolio of sustainably managed commercial forest plantation assets primarily in the Asia Pacific region</narrative>
